WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,840 --> 00:00:06,000
Back to Lijian, we threw a lot of stones at the window of the other tree, which made a lot of noise.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,560
But there was no reaction at all inside.

3
00:00:08,560 --> 00:00:10,840
It was pitch dark and no one could be seen.

4
00:00:10,840 --> 00:00:12,520
Maybe I slept too much

5
00:00:12,520 --> 00:00:14,760
Or deliberately pretending to be dead

6
00:00:14,760 --> 00:00:17,640
But they definitely have lots and lots of food

7
00:00:17,640 --> 00:00:19,720
That night we saw clearly

8
00:00:19,720 --> 00:00:22,000
The car was packed full of boxes and bags.

9
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,040
Maybe there will be wine and good stuff.

10
00:00:28,040 --> 00:00:30,160
Since there are so many good things

11
00:00:30,640 --> 00:00:33,160
Then let them share a little bit with us

12
00:00:33,160 --> 00:00:34,360
Not too much

13
00:00:35,320 --> 00:00:36,780
everyone is human

14
00:00:36,780 --> 00:00:40,140
Help each other to overcome difficulties at this time

15
00:00:40,140 --> 00:00:42,140
Isn’t that something normal and something that should be done?

16
00:00:42,140 --> 00:00:43,650
Yes, Sister Li is right

17
00:00:43,650 --> 00:00:45,210
There are just so many of them

18
00:00:45,210 --> 00:00:46,610
What's wrong with dividing us a little bit?

19
00:00:46,610 --> 00:00:48,790
They're all watching us starve to death.

20
00:00:48,790 --> 00:01:00,290
Then I'll say hello to you tomorrow, Sister Li.
